{
  "name": "Sanaku - W2s Send Approved (gate 2)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W2s — send approved drafts\n\n**Nothing sends unless `send_enabled` = 1 in `sanaku_settings`.**\nToggle it from the Outreach tab — it is a row, not an env var, so it can be\nturned off without shell access the moment something looks wrong.\n\n### Three brakes\n1. the global switch\n2. the daily ramp — `sanaku_claim_send_slot()` claims atomically, so two runs cannot both take the last slot\n3. the recipient gate — approved **and** verified **and** a decision maker\n\n### Turning it off in a hurry\nOutreach tab → the sending toggle. Takes effect on the next run, ≤30 min.\nRaise the ramp by editing `cap` in `sanaku_send_budget` for today —\nstart at 15/day and climb over weeks, never in one jump.\n\nOne message per run, every 30 min, 08:00–17:00 PT weekdays only.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "e0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -120
      ]
    },
